# Tiff AI Core 🚀  

The **core engine of Tiff AI**, powering intelligent e-commerce across Africa.  
It handles natural language processing, recommendations, vendor insights, and real-time search.  

## ✨ Features  
- 🧠 AI-powered product recommendations  
- 💬 Natural Language Processing (multi-language support, tailored for Africa)  
- 🔍 Smart real-time search  
- 📊 Vendor & customer analytics  

## 🛠 Tech Stack  
- Python, Node.js  
- TensorFlow / PyTorch  
- OpenAI API  
- MongoDB / MySQL  

## 🚀 Getting Started  

```bash
# Clone repo
git clone https://github.com/castro901-art/tiff-ai-core.git

# Install dependencies
npm install

# Start server
npm run dev
